# Email

Narrative and code map: [docs/email.md](../../docs/email.md). Read it before changing this area.

## Must preserve

- Enquiries are **mailto-only** — no server POST, no mail API, no `window.open` for send.
- Single inbox: `site.email` in `content.ts` (footer, privacy, JSON-LD, form).
- Gate invalid fields/dates before the link navigates; message max length and unsafe markup checks stay.
- Mailto body uses CRLF; assert-build expects `mailto:info@…` and no `window.open` on the contact page.
- Occupancy may disable nights in the UI; do not put occupancy status into the mailto body.
